{"id":"12440ec6dda74879","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-characteristicmodels.md","title":"Characteristic false points of a Horn function","display":"df-characteristicmodels — Characteristic false points of a Horn function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-characteristicmodels","aliases":["27-df-characteristicmodels"],"display":"df-characteristicmodels — Characteristic false points of a Horn function","depends_on":["[[27-df-meetclosure]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.3.1 Equation (6.8) and Corollary 6.4","source_statement":"Characteristic false points of a Horn function","source_printed_pages":"280","source_pdf_pages":"304","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-characteristicmodels"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-characteristicmodels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristicmodels — Characteristic false points of a Horn function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.3.1 Equation (6.8) and Corollary 6.4"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"12440ec6dda74879\" href=\"?note=12440ec6dda74879\" title=\"Characteristic false points of a Horn function\">Characteristic false points of a Horn function</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"280"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"304"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G(S)\\coloneqq\\{Q\\subseteq S:\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(Q)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\},\\qquad Q_n(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\mathcal G(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G(S)\\coloneqq\\{Q\\subseteq S:\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(Q)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\},\\qquad Q_n(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\mathcal G(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}(f)\\coloneqq Q_n(F(f))\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Char}(f)\\coloneqq Q_n(F(f))\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>生成族始终非空，因为 S 本身属于其中。交空输入时唯一生成子集是空集，故 Q_n(∅)=∅。在原书 DNF 约定中 characteristic models 是假点生成元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-meetclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"Characteristic false points of a Horn function","status":"resolved","id":"12440ec6dda74879","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Characteristic false points of a Horn function]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-meetclosure]]，$F(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-meetclosure]]，$F(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G(S)\\coloneqq\\{Q\\subseteq S:\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(Q)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(S)\\},\\qquad Q_n(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\mathcal G(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}(f)\\coloneqq Q_n(F(f))\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n).","display":true}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-characteristicmodels|df-characteristicmodels — Characteristic false points of a Horn function]]"},{"id":"d5b1d698b4105952","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$；$Q_n,\\mathcal G,\\mathrm{Char}$ 见 [[27-df-characteristicmodels]]。$h,g\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，Horn 假点交闭定理见 [[27-thm-hornchar]]；$g\\leq h$ 表示逐点不等式。"}],"outgoing":["ed790009f55244ee","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2"]}